<title>USA: Livingston, N.J., won by AH Williams.</title>
<headline>Livingston, N.J., won by AH Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>AH Williams &amp; Co, Inc said it won $2.840 million of Livingston, N.J., 1997 tax appeal refunding bonds, with a lowest rate of 3.7 8.</p>
